Modifications
-------------

Modified by James Stapleton (https://github.com/tasermonkey), October 2026 onwards. The fork
branches from upstream commit 85c35a5 (package version 0.3.7). Every change since then is in this
repository's git history (`git log 85c35a5..`). In summary:

- Runs on Node 24 and npm as native ES modules, without Bun; tests moved to Vitest. Imports were
  rewritten to relative paths with .ts extensions (tools/codemod-esm.ts).
- Engine fixes: ld/sd by reference ID, `define X 0`, the sandbox "no network for port" error,
  yield/sleep requesting a suspend instead of waiting in real time.
- Instruction behaviour changed to match the game (audit findings G13-G35): errors halt the chip,
  jal and branch-and-link set ra, batch reads over no devices, stack and device memory, slot
  reads, lr, jr, defines and malformed literals.
- Renamed misspelt identifiers and files, translated comments and messages to English, and
  documented the environment schema.
- Published under the npm name @tasermonkey/ic10, versioned separately from upstream.
